	"_comment": "Built-in default ladder of Spice of Life: Raspberry Pie Edition (vanilla effects only). Copied to <world>/serverconfig/solraspberrypie/ladder.json on first start unless defaultconfigs/solraspberrypie/ladder.json exists. Edits apply at the next server start. Rung types: health (amount in health points, 2 = one heart), attribute (attribute id, amount), flat (effect, level: always on while reached), slot (an effect slot), unlock (effect, level: pickable for slots, never lost). pool: the effects slots may hold, with their level cap. This default is Spice of Life: Apple Pie Edition's own default ladder (its health, armor toughness, knockback resistance and always-on effect benefits; its duplicate Strength I and its generic.speed entry, which names no attribute, left out) scaled to a top of 50 (half its thresholds: with vanilla foods and Apple Pie's default settings about 56 is the most a diet reaches), plus four effect slots and ten one-time unlocks spaced more densely at the start. Speed, Haste and Strength are not slottable: Apple Pie's flat rungs grant them before the first slot. Regeneration and Luck unlock before their flat rungs; once a flat rung holds an effect, a slot holding it can be changed for free.",
